      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that, that's much more helpful. for the labeling part, you mentioned using symbols. what kind of specific symbols or icons are standard in high-end catering to mark things like vegan or nut-free? and how do we make sure the staff doesn't accidentally mix things up during the rush of setting up the buffet?",
